1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:08,200
Introducing AgriConnect, a digital platform designed to simplify access to agricultural services

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:15,800
and connect Farmers with nearby agricultural service providers.

3
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:27,800
Finding reliable Machinery, available Labour and suitable Facilities can be challenging.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,200
AgriConnect brings all these Nearby Services together through one simple platform.

5
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:47,500
Users can enter AgriConnect with a simple mobile interface and choose their exact role.

6
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:56,200
Each role unlocks relevant Nearby Services and tailored dashboard features.

7
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:11,500
Farmers can explore available Machinery, discover Labour and find post-harvest Facilities.

8
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:25,000
Inspect real availability and submit Bookings directly through the AgriConnect platform.

9
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:39,500
AgriConnect empowers equipment owners to manage Machinery listings and availability.

10
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:55,500
Labour providers showcase skills and wages, while Facilities highlight storage capacity.

11
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:09,800
With location-based discovery, explore Nearby Services within your preferred radius.

12
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:22,500
The Bookings system connects Farmers and providers through a clear request workflow.

13
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:35,500
AgriConnect brings essential Machinery, Labour and Facilities closer to rural communities.

14
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:43,200
AgriConnect — connecting Farmers, empowering agriculture. Developed by Team ANOKA.
